ORIGINAL REQUEST:
Configuring a **Rollup** component to compute daily healthcare compliance audit metrics per care facility in the DACH region. 

The input metadata:
<Metadata id="AuditCheckMeta">
  <Record name="AuditCheck" type="delimited" fieldDelimiter="," recordDelimiter="\n">
    <Field name="pruef_lauf_id" type="string"/>
    <Field name="pruef_datum" type="date" format="yyyy-MM-dd" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="einrichtung_code" type="string" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="akten_geprueft" type="long" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="satz_pro_akte" type="decimal" length="10" scale="2" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="befund_art" type="string" nullable="false"/>
    <Field name="sofort_behoben" type="boolean" nullable="true"/>
    <Field name="nachfrist_bis" type="date" format="yyyy-MM-dd" nullable="true"/>
  </Record>
</Metadata>

The Rollup group key is set in the component to `einrichtung_code;pruef_datum`. The group accumulator metadata `AuditDayAcc` in the graph is:

<Metadata id="AuditDayAccMeta">
  <Record name="AuditDayAcc" type="complexData">
    <Field name="summe_akten" type="long"/>
    <Field name="offene_exposition" type="decimal" length="18" scale="2"/>
    <Field name="kritische_befunde" type="integer"/>
    <Field name="fristfaellige_befunde" type="integer"/>
    <Field name="frueheste_nachfrist" type="date" nullable="true"/>
  </Record>
</Metadata>

Output metadata::

<Metadata id="AuditTagesberichtMeta">
  <Record name="AuditTagesbericht" type="delimited" fieldDelimiter="," recordDelimiter="\n">
    <Field name="einrichtung_code" type="string"/>
    <Field name="pruef_datum" type="date" format="yyyy-MM-dd"/>
    <Field name="summe_akten" type="long"/>
    <Field name="durchschnitt_offene_exposition" type="decimal" length="18" scale="4"/>
    <Field name="offene_exposition" type="decimal" length="18" scale="2"/>
    <Field name="kritische_befunde" type="integer"/>
    <Field name="fristfaellige_befunde" type="integer"/>
    <Field name="frueheste_nachfrist" type="date" format="yyyy-MM-dd" nullable="true"/>
  </Record>
</Metadata>

Requirements:

- Group by `einrichtung_code` and `pruef_datum` (already set as group key).
- In the accumulator:
  - `summe_akten` = sum of `akten_geprueft`
  - `offene_exposition` = sum of `akten_geprueft * satz_pro_akte`, but **only** for findings that are still open, meaning `sofort_behoben` is null or false
  - `kritische_befunde` increments by 1 when the finding is both:
    - category `MEDIKATION` **or** category starts with `DATENSCHUTZ_`
    - and still open (`sofort_behoben` is null or false)
  - `fristfaellige_befunde` increments by 1 when `nachfrist_bis` is not null and `nachfrist_bis > pruef_datum`
  - `frueheste_nachfrist` should store the **earliest non-null** `nachfrist_bis` seen among still-open findings; leave it null if no still-open finding has a deadline
- In the output, for each group emit a single record where:
  - `einrichtung_code` and `pruef_datum` come from the first record in the group
  - `summe_akten`, `offene_exposition`, `kritische_befunde`, `fristfaellige_befunde`, and `frueheste_nachfrist` are taken from the accumulator
  - `durchschnitt_offene_exposition` = `offene_exposition / summe_akten`
- All input fields except `sofort_behoben` and `nachfrist_bis` are NOT NULL, so you do not need null checks on them.
- `frueheste_nachfrist` output is nullable and may remain null if no qualifying input value exists.

Handle `sofort_behoben` and `nachfrist_bis` nullability correctly. Also show how to ensure `frueheste_nachfrist` keeps the minimum qualifying deadline in the group.

PROPOSED CTL2 IMPLEMENTATION:
```ctl
//#CTL2

function void initGroup(AuditDayAcc grpAcc) {
    grpAcc.summe_akten = 0L;
    grpAcc.offene_exposition = 0D;
    grpAcc.kritische_befunde = 0;
    grpAcc.fristfaellige_befunde = 0;
    grpAcc.frueheste_nachfrist = null;
    return;
}

function boolean updateGroup(AuditDayAcc grpAcc) {
    grpAcc.summe_akten += $in.0.akten_geprueft;

    // Only accumulate exposition for still-open findings
    if (isnull($in.0.sofort_behoben) || !$in.0.sofort_behoben) {
        decimal aktenExpo = $in.0.akten_geprueft * $in.0.satz_pro_akte;
        grpAcc.offene_exposition += aktenExpo;

        // Critical findings: MEDIKATION or DATENSCHUTZ_*
        if (($in.0.befund_art == "MEDIKATION" || startsWith($in.0.befund_art, "DATENSCHUTZ_"))) {
            grpAcc.kritische_befunde++;
        }

        // Fristfaellige befunde: nachfrist_bis > pruef_datum
        if (!isnull($in.0.nachfrist_bis) && $in.0.nachfrist_bis > $in.0.pruef_datum) {
            grpAcc.fristfaellige_befunde++;
        }

        // Track earliest non-null nachfrist_bis among still-open findings
        if (!isnull($in.0.nachfrist_bis)) {
            if (isnull(grpAcc.frueheste_nachfrist) ||
                $in.0.nachfrist_bis < grpAcc.frueheste_nachfrist) {
                grpAcc.frueheste_nachfrist = $in.0.nachfrist_bis;
            }
        }
    }

    return true;
}

function boolean finishGroup(AuditDayAcc grpAcc) {
    return true;
}

function integer updateTransform(integer counter, AuditDayAcc grpAcc) {
    return SKIP;
}

function integer transform(integer counter, AuditDayAcc grpAcc) {
    if (counter > 0) return SKIP;

    $out.0.einrichtung_code = $in.0.einrichtung_code;
    $out.0.pruef_datum = $in.0.pruef_datum;

    $out.0.summe_akten = grpAcc.summe_akten;
    $out.0.offene_exposition = grpAcc.offene_exposition;
    $out.0.kritische_befunde = grpAcc.kritische_befunde;
    $out.0.fristfaellige_befunde = grpAcc.fristfaellige_befunde;
    $out.0.frueheste_nachfrist = grpAcc.frueheste_nachfrist;

    if (grpAcc.summe_akten > 0L) {
        $out.0.durchschnitt_offene_exposition =
            grpAcc.offene_exposition / grpAcc.summe_akten;
    } else {
        $out.0.durchschnitt_offene_exposition = 0D;
    }

    return OK;
}
```

