- Select tasa_virtual when canal_atencion starts with VIDEO- or servicio_juridico contains MIGRATORIO. Otherwise, select tasa_laboral when servicio_juridico starts with LABORAL-. Use tasa_base for all remaining reservations.
- A null selected rate is zero. monto_anticipo is honorario_cotizado multiplied by tasa_anticipo divided by 100, rounded to two decimals.
